
// Call Of Duty: Black Ops II
>game,T6

// magmagat_quest_donor - ONE asset: luckass's fxanim_props.atr (his superset of
// the stock tree, Unlinker-dumped from his 1.0.5 mod.ff, 33,455 B / 1089 lines).
// The Magmagat quest's smelter ghouls (his %mg_ghoul_smelter_1/_2) only exist in
// this tree. common_zm.ff carries the stock copy of the same NAME and is
// --load'ed before any later donor could win it, so this donor sits BEFORE
// common_zm in build_ff.bat's --load chain: first-load-wins then resolves the
// main build's decl (mod_locations.zone: rawfile,animtrees/fxanim_props.atr)
// from here. Source ff: zone_source/magmagat_donor/mod.ff's own source
// (luckass's release mod.ff, MIT, credited).
// Built with the same recipe as magmagat_donor (how_this_was_built.zone.txt):
//   Linker.exe --load "<luckass rel-1.0.5 mod.ff>" --base-folder "<this folder>"
//     --add-source-search-path "<this folder>" --output-folder "<this folder>\out" mod
rawfile,animtrees/fxanim_props.atr
